function vwV(){var r=[['hstyles','H Styles','hs'],['Zee','Z','zee'],['NiniH','NiniH','nini'],['Lipayn','Li','li'],['lawsociety','Law Society',''],['moot.court','Moot Court','']];return '<div class="sh-bg" data-a="vx" style="z-index:8"></div><div class="sh" style="z-index:9;max-height:520px;overflow:auto"><div class="gp"></div><b class="sh-t">Viewers · 2,431</b>'+r.map(function(x){return '<div class="shr">'+av(x[2]?AV[x[2]]:'',44,x[0])+'<div><b>'+x[0]+'</b><div class="mu">'+x[1]+'</div></div></div>';}).join('')+'</div>';}
function render(kp){var v,y=kp?($('.igc').scrollTop()||0):0;
if(S.view=='pf')v=pfV();else if(S.view=='post')v=postV();else if(S.view=='srch')v=srchV();else if(S.view=='th')v=thV();else if(S.view=='arch')v=archV();else if(S.view=='hpost')v=hpostV(); else v={home:homeV,explore:expV,reels:reelsV,dm:dmV,me:meV}[S.tab]();
$('#igroot').html('<div class="igc">'+v+'</div>'+tabbar()+(S.sheet?sheet():'')+(S.hv?hvV():'')+(S.login?loginV():'')+(S.pr?stpV():'')+(S.rs?rsV():'')+(S.vw?vwV():''));
$('.igc').scrollTop(y);if(window.RL)RL.init();$('.screen').toggleClass('light',!S.hv);clearTimeout(T);if(S.hv&&!S.vw){T=setTimeout(function(){adv();},5000);}}
function mount(){clearTimeout(T);S.view=null;S.sheet=false;S.hv=null;S.vw=false;S.rs=0;S.pr=false;S.from=null;var st0=State.variables.igStart;if(st0){S.tab='home';S.view='pf';S.pu=st0;S.from='home';State.variables.igStart=0;}render();
$(document).off('click.hph.ig').on('click.hph.ig','#igroot [data-a]',function(){var t=$(this),d=t.data('a'),k=t.data('k'),kp=0;
if(d=='tab'){S.tab=k;S.view=null;}
else if(d=='srch'){S.view='srch';}
else if(d=='back'){S.view=(S.from=='srch')?'srch':null;S.from=null;}
else if(d=='post'){S.view='post';S.i=t.data('i');}
else if(d=='sheet'){S.sheet=true;}
else if(d=='close'){S.sheet=false;}
else if(d=='sw'){S.sheet=false;if(k=='priv'&&!S.auth){S.login=true;S.err=0;}else{S.acct=k;S.tab='me';S.view=null;}}
else if(d=='login'){if(String($('#igpw').val()).replace(/\s+/g,'').toLowerCase()==PW){S.auth=true;S.login=false;S.err=0;S.acct='priv';S.tab='me';S.view=null;}else{S.err=1;}}
else if(d=='lc'){S.login=false;S.err=0;}
else if(d=='lk'){LK[k]=!LK[k];kp=1;}
else if(d=='hl'){S.hv={k:t.data('i'),j:0};}
else if(d=='hn'){adv();return;}
else if(d=='hp'){S.hv.j=Math.max(0,S.hv.j-1);}
else if(d=='hx'){if(S.hv&&S.hv.k==-2)mark(S.hv.u);S.hv=null;S.vw=false;}
else if(d=='sshare'){State.variables.zStory=2;State.variables.zayn=(State.variables.zayn|0)+5;S.pr=false;S.rs=1;}
else if(d=='sno'){State.variables.zStory=3;S.pr=false;}
else if(d=='rx'){S.rs=0;}
else if(d=='ms'){S.hv={k:-1,j:0};}
else if(d=='vw'){S.vw=true;}
else if(d=='vx'){S.vw=false;}
else if(d=='hsp'){if(k)S.pu=k;S.view='hpost';S.i=t.data('i');}
else if(d=='hsb'){S.view=(S.pu=='hs')?null:'pf';}
else if(d=='pu'){S.from=S.view;S.pu=k;S.view='pf';} else if(d=='th'){S.view='th';S.th=k;} else if(d=='thb'){S.view=null;S.tab='dm';} else if(d=='sv'){S.hv={k:-2,j:0,u:k};} else if(d=='hlo'){S.hv={k:t.data('i'),j:0,o:k};} else if(d=='arch'){S.view='arch';} else if(d=='av'){S.hv={k:-3,j:t.data('i')};} else if(d=='fol'){var v=State.variables,f=v.igfH=v.igfH||{},cur=F(k);if(k=='priv'&&!cur&&State.variables.loumierePublic===0){f[k]=(f[k]===2)?0:2;}else{f[k]=cur?0:1;v.igdH=(v.igdH|0)+(cur?-1:1);}if(k=='lou'){State.variables.hFollowsLou=F('lou')?1:0;}}
render(kp);});
$(document).off('keydown.hph.ig').on('keydown.hph.ig','#igpw',function(e){if(e.which==13){$('#igroot [data-a="login"]').trigger('click');}});
$(document).off('dblclick.hph.ig').on('dblclick.hph.ig','#igroot [data-lk]',function(){LK[$(this).data('lk')]=1;render(1);});}
return {mount:mount};})();
